rcopy
Copy SOURCE to DEST

Usage: rcopy [options] <source> <dest>

Arguments:
  <source>       File to copy
  <dest>         Where to copy it

Options:
  -f, --force    Overwrite destination if it exists
  -v, --verbose  Show progress information
  -h, --help     Show this help
